<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Developing Myself - 3D Experience</title>
    <style>
        /* CSS Styles */
        :root {
            /* Vibrant Palette */
            --bg-color: #0c001a; /* Very dark purple for contrast */
            --primary: #ff007f;   /* Hot Pink */
            --secondary: #6200ea; /* Deep Purple */
            --accent: #ffae00;    /* Amber/Gold */
            --text-light: #ffffff;
            --glass-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Poppins', 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; /* Poppins added for a modern feel */
            margin: 0;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: var(--text-light);
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 10% 20%, rgba(98, 0, 234, 0.1) 0%, rgba(12, 0, 26, 0.1) 90.1%);
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* Basic Setup for elements that need depth */
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            transform-style: preserve-3d; /* Key for 3D interactions */
        }

        /* 3D Header */
        header {
            background: rgba(12, 0, 26, 0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px); /* Glass effect */
            color: white;
            padding: 1.2rem 5%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--accent));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 25px;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            position: relative;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: var(--accent);
            transform: translateY(-2px); /* Subtle float */
        }

        /* 3D Hero Section */
        .hero {
            height: 70vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 0 20px;
            perspective: 1000px; /* Essential for 3D perspective */
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 4rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 30%, var(--accent) 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            /* Simple 3D depth effect via text shadow */
            text-shadow: 0 1px 0 #ccc, 
                         0 2px 0 #c9c9c9, 
                         0 3px 0 #bbb, 
                         0 4px 0 #b9b9b9, 
                         0 5px 0 #aaa, 
                         0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }

        /* The main container acts as the scene */
        .container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: -50px auto 40px auto; /* Pulls content up over hero */
            padding: 20px;
            perspective: 1000px; /* Applies perspective to children */
        }

        /* The 3D Glass Card */
        .card {
            background: var(--glass-bg);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
            margin-bottom: 50px;
            
            /* The deep 3D shadow */
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
            
            /* Initial 3D tilt */
            transform: rotateX(5deg) rotateY(-5deg);
            transition: transform 0.5s ease, box-shadow 0.5s ease;
        }

        .card:hover {
            /* Standard hover to flatten it, emphasizing interaction */
            transform: rotateX(0deg) rotateY(0deg) scale(1.02);
            box-shadow: 0 35px 60px -10px rgba(255,0,127,0.3); /* Colorful shadow on hover */
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        /* 3D Isometric Goals Grid */
        .goals-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
            margin-top: 30px;
            perspective: 2000px; /* Stronger scene perspective for the items */
        }

        /* The Isometric Goal Blocks */
        .goal-item {
            background: var(--glass-bg);
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            color: var(--text-light);
            
            /* Main shadow to lift the block */
            box-shadow: 10px 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
            
            /* Core 3D Transformation (Skew and Rotate creates isometric feel) */
            transform: rotateX(10deg) rotateY(-15deg) rotateZ(5deg);
            transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275); /* Bouncy hover */
            
            /* Adding a gradient "top edge" for depth */
            position: relative;
        }

        .goal-item::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 5px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary), var(--accent));
            border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;
        }

        .goal-item:hover {
            transform: translateZ(20px) rotateX(0deg) rotateY(0deg) rotateZ(0deg); /* Lifts straight up */
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(98, 0, 234, 0.5); /* Glow shadow */
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
        }

        .goal-item strong {
            display: block;
            color: var(--accent);
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 50px;
            background: #06000d;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            margin-top: 50px;
            box-shadow: 0 -10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        /* Mobile Adjustments for 3D */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; }
            .card { transform: none; } /* Flatten major cards on mobile for readability */
            .card:hover { transform: scale(1.01); }
            .goal-item { transform: rotateX(5deg); } /* Reduce tilt on mobile */
        }
    </style>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;600;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div class="logo"><strong>Growth</strong>Journey</div>
        <nav>
            <a href="#about">About</a>
            <a href="#goals">Goals</a>
            <a href="#vision">Vision</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
        <h1>Developing Myself</h1>
        <p>A digital archive of transformation and progress.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="container">
        <section id="about" class="card">
            <h2>The Mission</h2>
            <p>Welcome to this vibrant, experimental space dedicated to personal growth. This is more than a journal; it's a 3D interface designed to track my transformation, synthesize my learnings, and visually represent the architecture of my self-improvement. Every interaction here reminds me to build upwards.</p>
        </section>

        <section id="goals" class="goals-grid">
            <div class="goal-item">
                <strong>01 // Cognitive Expansion</strong>
                <p>Focusing on advanced problem solving, deep work, and learning complex systems like web application architecture.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="goal-item">
                <strong>02 // Core Fortitude</strong>
                <p>Prioritizing physical strength through progressive overload training and metabolic conditioning four times a week.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="goal-item">
                <strong>03 // Mindful Stillness</strong>
                <p>Allocating 20 minutes daily for meditation to improve focus, emotional regulation, and presence.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="goal-item">
                <strong>04 // Financial Geometry</strong>
                <p>Optimizing investment strategies and diversifying income streams through scalable digital projects.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="vision" class="card" style="margin-top: 50px;">
            <h2>Vision 2026</h2>
            <p>I aim to construct a life defined by autonomy, creative mastery, and resilient health. This website is the initial blueprint for that construction. By modifying my environment, expanding my skillset, and refining my habits, I am actively engineering my future self. The blocks I lay today define the heights I reach tomorrow.</p>
        </section>
    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 <span style="color: var(--accent);">Developing Myself</span> // Built for Growth.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
